            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[A smoother start and easier updates.

• Fixes a ZIP packaging issue that could show a “damaged app” warning after unpacking the download.
• Adds Check for Updates to the IRIS menu, menu-bar companion and About page.
• Checks for signed updates automatically, with an optional automatic-download setting.
• Verifies updates before unpacking them and waits for an active scan to finish before restarting.
• Keeps your saved review, trusted items and dashboard connection.
